<title>USA: Philadelphia Fed index 5.3 October vs 13.9 Sept.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia Fed index 5.3 October vs 13.9 Sept.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia said on Thursday its diffusion index of business activity in the manufacturing sector fell to 5.3 in October from 13.9 in September.</p>
<p>				Oct   Drop   Unch   Rise    Sept</p>
<p>Business Conditions     5.3   22.0   49.6   27.3    13.9</p>
<p>New orders		  9.9   24.4   41.3   34.3    16.8</p>
<p>Shipments		  11.9   19.9   45.1   31.9    24.1</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	 - 9.8   28.3   51.6   18.5     2.0</p>
<p>Delivery time	   -13.7   19.6   73.1    5.9   - 2.2</p>
<p>Inventories	     - 2.7   24.7   53.2   22.0   -11.5</p>
<p>Prices paid		21.9    2.8   68.7   24.7    18.0</p>
<p>Prices received	   5.4    9.5   75.7   14.9     4.6</p>
<p>Number of employees   - 4.7   17.4   70.0   12.7     9.5</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-869-1660</p>
</text>
